===== 7. documented deletion and visibility semantics (docs.github.com) =====
FOUND: You cannot delete a public package if any version of the package has more than 5,000 downloads.
FOUND: A specific version of a public package, if the package version doesn't have more than 5,000 downloads
FOUND: You restore the package within 30 days of its deletion.
FOUND: The same package namespace is still available and not used for a new package.
FOUND: GitHub Packages only supports authentication using a personal access token (classic).
FOUND: When you first publish a package that is scoped to your personal account, the default visibility is private and only you can see the package.
